ballot @sf "City of San Francisco"

  section "Executive Offices"

    contest @sf-mayor "Mayor of San Francisco" ranked

      campaign incumbent @london-breed "London Breed"
      campaign @daniel-lurie "Daniel Lurie"
      campaign @mark-farrell "Mark Farrell"
      campaign @aaron-peskin "Aaron Peskin"
      campaign @ahsha-safai "Ahsha Safaí"
      campaign @ellen-lee-zhou "Ellen Lee Zhou"
      campaign @dylan-hirsch-shell "Dylan Hirsch-Shell"
      campaign @keith-freedman "Keith Freedman"
      campaign @nelson-mei "Nelson Mei"
      campaign @shahram-shariati "Shahram Shariati"
      campaign @henry-flynn "Henry Flynn"
      campaign @paul-ybarra-robertson "Paul Ybarra Robertson"
      campaign @jon-ernest-soderstrom "Jon Ernest Soderstrom"

      recommend
        support @london-breed @daniel-lurie
        support @mark-farrell
        oppose @aaron-peskin
        justification:
          Do not, under any circumstances, rank Aaron Peskin anywhere on your ballot.
          Overall this is not a great mayoral election. London Breed has been an OK but
          not great mayor, Lurie is kind of an unknown quantity, and the rest of these
          clowns are a serious downgrade from Breed. I won't really be happy with any of
          these outcomes.
        note:
          Rank Breed and Lurie first and second in either order. Farrell third, if you
          must.

